# Count each cycle collection (runs by what asked, GC objects walked and freed,
# the heap's bytes before and after, the next threshold, the most one run walked)
# and, with a host clock, time it: what a page's collector costs, readable at any
# moment without the ledger's per-call brackets. One addition per object walked.
